# Host platforms

All platforms have Host entry (#119, #122, #126); availability needs proof.
A new Host needs the bound target's surveyed runtime and installed Runner with a
valid entry. Unknown stays unknown; never substitute the outer PATH. A live Host
keeps its platform; Host choice and worker grants are separate.
Rows: platforms/<id>.yaml; empty entry means host-entry-unsupported.

Before Host choice/change, read its version-matched checkout row:
`docs/host-compact-capabilities.md`; disclose material limits, unknowns, impact
and recovery. Keep owner choice; no extra approval or automatic switch.

